  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Welikerma Rural Women Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide capacity building training and a revolving fund for the group to produce and sell value-added white rice at a higher price and provide marketing training that will help the group to target buyers other than the World Food Program.</narrative>
  </description>
